# Local Repo MCP — Lightweight Security Runtime

Read `AGENTS.md` before any code change.

## Scope

Single-repo MCP server: safe read, filtered git, validated text patch, optional trusted-repo tests.

## Never add

Session, RBAC, risk scoring, policy YAML, agent branches, patch approval workflow, Docker sandbox, shell tools, tunnel auto-download, persisted API keys.

## Always enforce

- Relative paths only; reject `..`, absolute paths, symlinks
- `guard.py` denylist for read/write
- Filter git status and diff
- Ripgrep: `--fixed-strings`, `-e`, `--`, `shell=False`
- Single-step `repo_apply_patch` only
- Seven MCP tools only
